Thai Waters Rev F | ts_board_45C
* TS source set to 50 uA; R29 represented by 4924 ohm.
* Model: AXP TS divider with 3.3 V source compliance, conceptual linearized saturation. R29 sits on the board; cell temperature is unobservable through the two-wire J7.
Iexcite 0 ts 50u
R29 ts 0 4924
Vdd v 0 3.3
Dclamp ts v ideal
.MODEL ideal D(IS=1e-8 N=0.05)
.TRAN 1u 10u
.PRINT TRAN V(ts)
.END
